WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
Mobile recording with JavaScript disabled. Invented inputs only.

00:02.500 --> 00:06.000
Unknown birth time stays unknown. Ordinary forms save the profile.

00:06.000 --> 00:09.500
The chart withholds calculations that need precise birth time.

00:09.500 --> 00:13.000
With no approved source corpus, the reading explains insufficient evidence.

00:13.000 --> 00:18.000
Library and data controls remain available without JavaScript.

00:18.000 --> 00:21.000
The worker finishes a private, expiring export.

00:21.000 --> 00:22.500
Explicit confirmation revokes access and queues workspace deletion.
